                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the American Delegation</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-03-03T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 3, 1926—5
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>12. Your Conference 26, March 3, 3 p.m. Your attitude regarding negotiations
                    approved.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
